        }
      }
    },
    "Each Voice Input recording is uploaded to %@ and turned into text under %@'s terms. Heeler keeps no copy once the text arrives." : {
      "comment" : "Voice Input consent. %1$@ is the service host name, %2$@ the company that runs it.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "音声入力の各録音は %1$@ にアップロードされ、%2$@ の規約に従ってテキスト化されます。テキストを受け取った後、Heeler はコピーを保持しません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each Voice Input recording is uploaded to %@ and turned into text under the terms of whoever runs it. Heeler keeps no copy once the text arrives." : {
      "comment" : "Voice Input consent. %@ is the service host name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "音声入力の各録音は %@ にアップロードされ、その運営者の規約に従ってテキスト化されます。テキストを受け取った後、Heeler はコピーを保持しません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each field needs at least one value. A value may be empty." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "各フィールドには少なくとも 1 つの値が必要です。値自体は空でも構いません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each harness keeps up to four Accounts on a Host. Chat finds conversations in all of them." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "各ハーネスはホスト上に最大 4 個のアカウントを持てます。チャットはそのすべてから会話を見つけます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each harness’s config folders on a Host, such as a second Claude Code or Codex sign-in. Kept on the Host for every device; Usage, Chat and Launch Presets read them." : {
      "localizations" : {
