          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Grok Build's screen shows another session. If you just ran /new or /clear, Chat follows it in a moment; send again then. Otherwise switch back to this conversation in the terminal first." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
